@startuml Consume Inventory Reply (Reserved / Failed)

title Ordering 消費 Inventory 對出庫預留的回覆 → Processing 轉 Pending 或 Rejected

box "Inventory" #LightYellow
    participant "OutboxProcessor" as InventoryOutbox
end box

queue "Kafka\ntopic: inventory.events" as Kafka
queue "Kafka\ntopic: inventory.events.dlq" as DLQ

box "Ordering" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IntegrationEventConsumer" as Consumer
    participant "IPublisher" as Publisher
    participant "OutboundInventoryReserved/\nFailedIntegrationEventHandler" as Handler
    participant "IOutboundOrderRepository" as Repo
    participant "OutboundOrder" as Order
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

InventoryOutbox -> Kafka : produce OutboundInventoryReservedIntegrationEvent\n或 OutboundInventoryReservationFailedIntegrationEvent
activate Consumer
Kafka -> Consumer : consumer.Consume()
Consumer -> Consumer : 讀 "EventType" header\n查 subscriptionOptions.EventTypes

alt EventType 沒對到已註冊的事件，或 payload 反序列化失敗
    Consumer -> DLQ : PublishToDeadLetterAsync\n(Key/Value 原樣 + Error/FailedAt header)
else 正常
    Consumer -> Publisher : PublishAsync(notification, ct)
    Publisher -> Handler : HandleAsync(notification, ct)

    Handler -> Repo : GetByIdAsync(notification.OutboundOrderId, ct)

    alt 找不到這張單
        Repo --> Handler : Result.Failure
        Handler -> Handler : logger.LogError(...)（不拋例外，靜默結束）
    else 找到
        Repo --> Handler : OutboundOrder

        alt 收到 Reserved
            Handler -> Order : MarkReserved()
            alt Status != Processing（重複消費或狀態已經前進過）
                Order --> Handler : Result.Failure
                Handler -> Handler : logger.LogWarning(...)（不拋例外）
            else
                Order -> Order : Status = Pending
                Order --> Handler : Result.Success
                Handler -> Repo : SaveAsync(order, ct)
                Repo -> DB : update outbound_orders
            end
        else 收到 Failed
            Handler -> Order : FailReservation("庫存不足，系統自動拒絕")
            alt Status != Processing
                Order --> Handler : Result.Failure
                Handler -> Handler : logger.LogWarning(...)
            else
                Order -> Order : Status = Rejected\nRejectReason = "庫存不足，系統自動拒絕"
                Order --> Handler : Result.Success
                Handler -> Repo : SaveAsync(order, ct)
                Repo -> DB : update outbound_orders
            end
        end
    end
end

Publisher --> Consumer : 完成
Consumer -> Kafka : consumer.Commit(result)（手動 commit offset）
deactivate Consumer

note over Handler
  這兩個 handler 沒有 InboxGuard——跟 Inventory
  端的消費者不同。原因是 MarkReserved()/
  FailReservation() 本身有「Status != Processing
  就失敗」的 guard clause，天然就是 idempotent，
  Kafka at-least-once 重送不會造成重複扣減這類問題，
  不需要額外的去重表。
end note

@enduml
